SCOPE / 適用範囲

This license covers the material that sagebase itself created: the documents in
this repository, and the structure, normalization, entity-resolution results,
graph nodes/edges, sagebase_id identifiers, aggregates, and quality metadata of
the published datasets.

It does NOT cover the underlying source material published by Japanese
assemblies -- verbatim minutes of proceedings, bill texts, and the wording of
recorded votes. Those remain subject to the publication conditions set by each
assembly, and sagebase is not in a position to license them. If you intend to
redistribute the verbatim source text at scale, check the conditions of the
originating assembly yourself.

See https://sage-base.com/terms/ for the full terms (Japanese).

本ライセンスは sagebase が独自に付与した部分（本リポジトリのドキュメント、公開
データセットの構造・正規化・名寄せ結果・グラフ・sagebase_id・集計値・品質メタ
データ）に適用されます。議事録の発言原文など各議会が公開した情報そのものは適用
対象外で、各議会の公開条件に従います。詳細は https://sage-base.com/terms/

